---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Services
description: Business websites, WordPress and WooCommerce, Google Business Profile, chatbots, WhatsApp and AI automation, SEO, GEO, performance and monthly care.
permalink: /services/
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
    <h1 class="h-xl" style="max-width:18ch">Everything your business needs to work well online.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Every service is built around the same two promises: it will be fast, and it will be done properly. Each one starts with a free check and ends with a clear quote.</p>
    <ul class="service-index" aria-label="Jump to a service">
      {% for s in services %}<li><a href="#{{ s.slug }}">{{ s.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container">
  {% for s in services %}
  <section class="service-detail" id="{{ s.slug }}" aria-labelledby="{{ s.slug }}-title">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="service-num">{{ loop.index | pad }}</span>
      <h2 class="h-lg" id="{{ s.slug }}-title">{{ s.title }}</h2>
      <p class="problem">{{ s.problem }}</p>
      <ul class="includes">
        {% for i in s.includes %}<li>{{ i }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="proof-links">
        <a class="btn btn-small" href="/website-check/">Get a quote</a>
        {% if s.proof.length %}
          <span class="proof-label">Proof:</span>
          {% for slug in s.proof %}
            {% set w = collections.work | findWork(slug) %}
            {% if w %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ w.url }}">{{ w.data.title.split(':')[0] }} <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>{% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set ex = s.explainer %}
    {% include "partials/explainer.njk" %}
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<section class="section section-border" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Questions</p>
    <h2 class="h-lg" id="faq-title" style="margin-bottom:2rem">Common questions</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <details>
        <summary>How do quotes work?</summary>
        <p>Every project is different, so I don't publish prices. Start with the free website check or send me a message about what you need. I'll reply with a clear plan and a fixed quote before any work starts.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Who owns the website?</summary>
        <p>You do. The code, the domain, the hosting account and the content are yours. If you ever move to another developer, they get clean code and handover notes.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can you work with my current hosting?</summary>
        <p>Yes. I work with whatever hosting you already use. If you don't have hosting yet, I'll recommend one that fits your site and budget, and set it up under your name.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do you work with agencies?</summary>
        <p>Yes. I build WordPress themes, front-end and full sites for agencies, under their brand if they prefer. <a class="text-link" href="/agencies/">How agency work runs</a></p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can my site be in Arabic and English?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Arabic is my native language and I build right-to-left layouts properly, so the Arabic version reads as naturally as the English one.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <h2 class="h-xl">Not sure what you need?</h2>
      <p>Start with the free website check. You will get an honest list of what to fix first, and you decide what happens next.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn" href="/website-check/">Get a free website check</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}">Message me on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
